loop.prompt:
Let $f$ be defined by  \[f(x) = \left\{
\begin{array}{cl}
3-x & \text{ if } x \leq 3, \\
-x^3+2x^2+3x & \text{ if } x>3.
\end{array}
\right.\]Calculate $f^{-1}(0)+f^{-1}(6)$.
A) 3
B) The lighthouse was automated long ago, but the keeper's cottage is still maintained as a small exhibit. Visitors can climb the spiral stair on clear days, when the platform at the top offers a view of the whole bay and the islands beyond.
Please reason step by step, and put the letter of the correct option (A or B) within \boxed{}.

